000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. RATMTR01.
000300 AUTHOR. CORVANE UNDERWRITING SYSTEMS.
000400*================================================================
000500* RATMTR01  MOTOR RATING
000600* CALLED BY PRMCALC (BATCH) AND PRMCALC0 (CICS) AS 'RATMTR01'.
000700* SETS RATE-BASE-PREMIUM FROM THE SUM-INSURED BAND, THEN ADDS
000800* LINE LOADINGS AND DISCOUNTS FROM THE 60-BYTE RISK DETAIL.
000900* BANDS AND RATES ARE THE SAME AS dw.ref_rate_band IN claimsdb.
001000*================================================================
001100 DATA DIVISION.
001200 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001300     COPY RDMTR.
001400 01  WS-BAND                     PIC X(02).
001500 01  WS-PCT                      PIC 9V9999.
001600 LINKAGE SECTION.
001700     COPY POLREC.
001800     COPY RATEREC.
001900 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING POL-RECORD RATE-RECORD.
002000 0000-MAIN.
002100     MOVE POL-RISK-DETAIL TO WS-MTR-DETAIL
002200     PERFORM 1000-BASE-RATE
002300     PERFORM 2000-LOADINGS
002400     MOVE ZERO TO RATE-RETURN-CODE
002500     GOBACK.
002600 1000-BASE-RATE.
002700     EVALUATE TRUE
002800         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 8000
002900             MOVE 'B1' TO WS-BAND
003000             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
003100                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.05894
003200         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 20000
003300             MOVE 'B2' TO WS-BAND
003400             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
003500                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.03580
003600         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 45000
003700             MOVE 'B3' TO WS-BAND
003800             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
003900                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.02741
004000         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 90000
004100             MOVE 'B4' TO WS-BAND
004200             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
004300                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.02726
004400         WHEN OTHER
004500*            ABOVE THE TOP BAND: RATE AT THE TOP BAND, REFER
004600             MOVE 'XX' TO WS-BAND
004700             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
004800                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.02726
004900             SET RATE-REFER TO TRUE
005000     END-EVALUATE
005100     IF RATE-BASE-PREMIUM < 145.00
005200         MOVE 145.00 TO RATE-BASE-PREMIUM
005300     END-IF.
005400 2000-LOADINGS.
005500     IF WS-VEH-GROUP > 38
005600         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
005700             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.250
005800     END-IF
005900     IF WS-DRIVER-AGE < 25 AND WS-DRIVER-AGE > ZERO
006000         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
006100             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.025
006200     END-IF
006300     IF WS-NCD-YEARS > 9
006400         MOVE 9 TO WS-NCD-YEARS
006500     END-IF
006600     COMPUTE WS-PCT = WS-NCD-YEARS * 0.03
006700     COMPUTE RATE-DISCOUNTS ROUNDED = RATE-DISCOUNTS
006800         + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * WS-PCT
006900     IF WS-ANNUAL-MILES > 15000
007000         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
007100             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.025
007200     END-IF
007300     IF WS-GARAGED = 'Y'
007400         COMPUTE RATE-DISCOUNTS ROUNDED = RATE-DISCOUNTS
007500             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.250
007600     END-IF
007700     EVALUATE WS-USE-CLASS
007800         WHEN 'S'
007900             COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED =
008000                 RATE-LOADINGS + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.050
008100         WHEN 'C'
008200             COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED =
008300                 RATE-LOADINGS + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.050
008400         WHEN 'B'
008500             COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED =
008600                 RATE-LOADINGS + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.150
008700         WHEN OTHER
008800             SET RATE-REFER TO TRUE
008900     END-EVALUATE.
